  "body": "This attempts to make the navigation algorithm slightly more\ncomprehensible by factoring out the conversion of javascript: URL\nrequetss into responses into a dedicated algorithm, instead of having it\noccupy about half of the main \"navigate\" algorithm. The factored-out\nalgorithm is also slightly modernized and cleaned up in various ways.\n\n---\n\nWith this in hand the main \"navigate\" algorithm is down to 13 fairly-comprehensible steps (only 17 including substeps). One or two more refactorings like this (e.g. #3327) and we can start working on things like making all arguments explicit instead of relying on a bunch of ambient floating state.\n\n\n<!--\n    This comment and the below content is programatically generated.\n    You may add a comma-separated list of anchors you'd like a\n    direct link to below (e.g. #idl-serializers, #idl-sequence):\n\n    Don't remove this comment or modify anything below this line.\n    If you don't want a preview generated for this pull request,\n    just replace the whole of this comment's content by \"no preview\"\n    and remove what's below.\n-->\n***\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4396/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 27, 2019, 5:16 PM UTC (17f7d5f)\">/browsing-the-web.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4396/7ba9854...17f7d5f/browsing-the-web.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 27, 2019, 5:16 PM UTC (17f7d5f)\">diff</a> )\n<a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4396/server-sent-events.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 27, 2019, 5:16 PM UTC (17f7d5f)\">/server-sent-events.html</a>  ( <a href=\"https://whatpr.org/html/4396/7ba9854...17f7d5f/server-sent-events.html\" title=\"Last updated on Feb 27, 2019, 5:16 PM UTC (17f7d5f)\">diff</a> )",
